# awinic aw35615 pd controller driver configuration
#

config  TYPEC_HUSB311
	tristate "HUSB311 Type-C PD"
	depends on I2C
	help
		This option enables support for the HUSB311 Typec-C PD
		connected through I2C.

		To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the
		module will be called tcpci-husb311.
